WEBVTT

00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:32.565
There was a lot of yelling,

00:02:32.565 --> 00:02:34.483
a lot of chaos,

00:02:34.525 --> 00:02:36.402
and I controlled none of it.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.740
From the pages of my comics,

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:42.825
I was the one calling the shots.

00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:48.456
Creating my own worlds,
creating my own characters.

00:02:48.497 --> 00:02:52.585
Sharing them with my friends
and family members.

00:02:53.794 --> 00:02:56.130
I thrived off that creativity.

00:02:57.965 --> 00:03:02.136
Now my mother was an incredibly
talented artist.